    "slug": "backup-recovery/self-backup",
    "locale": "en",
    "section": "backup-recovery",
    "html": "<p>SaaSBase can take a self-backup of its own PostgreSQL database under <strong>Data -> Backups -> Take Self-Backup</strong>.</p>\n<p>The backup bundle contains:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Complete PostgreSQL database dump via <code>pg_dump</code>.</li>\n<li>Metadata manifest (schema version, timestamp, instance marker).</li>\n<li>Encryption using OpenSSL AES-256-CBC PBKDF2 with your master <code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>.</li>\n</ol>"
