    "section": "getting-started",
    "html": "<p>The fastest way to install SaaSBase on a brand new Ubuntu or Debian VPS is using the automated installer script (<code>install.sh</code>).</p>\n<h2>1-Command Installation</h2>\n<p>Connect to your server via SSH as <code>root</code> and run:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsSL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saasbase/saasbase/main/scripts/install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sudo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --repo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> saasbase/saasbase</span></span></code></pre>\n<div class=\"docCallout docCallout-note\"><div class=\"docCalloutHeader\"><span class=\"docCalloutBadge\">NOTE</span><span class=\"docCalloutTitle\">Custom Repository</span></div><div class=\"docCalloutContent\">\n<p>Replace <code>saasbase/saasbase</code> with your own GitHub organization or Gitea/Forgejo repository if running from a private fork.</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2>What the Installer Does Automatically</h2>\n<p>The installer script is completely <strong>idempotent</strong> and performs the following tasks:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Environment Verification:</strong> Checks root privileges, operating system compatibility, available CPU, RAM (recommends at least 2 GB), and ensures port <code>3000</code> is open.</li>\n<li><strong>Docker Provisioning:</strong> Installs Docker CE from Docker's official apt repository if not already installed.</li>\n<li><strong>Secret Generation:</strong> Creates <code>/opt/saasbase</code> directory with permission <code>0600</code> holding cryptographically secure secrets:\n<ul>\n<li><code>ENCRYPTION_KEY</code> (32 bytes hex)</li>\n<li><code>SESSION_SECRET</code> (32 bytes hex)</li>\n<li><code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code> (32 bytes hex)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>One-Time Setup Token:</strong> Generates a secure <code>SETUP_TOKEN</code> and prints it to your terminal. This token is required to claim the administrator account on first login, preventing unauthorized takeover.</li>\n<li><strong>Starts Container Services:</strong> Pulls <code>docker-compose.prod.yml</code>, brings up the PostgreSQL and SaaSBase containers, and waits until the health check at <code>/api/health</code> passes.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Useful Installation Options</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Specify a custom installation directory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data/saasbase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Bind panel to localhost only (recommended when using SSH Tunnel or reverse proxy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --panel-bind</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 127.0.0.1:3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Attach custom domain with automated Let's Encrypt SSL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --domain</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> panel.yourdomain.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Re-run installer to change or upgrade version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Uninstall SaaSBase (retains database and .env configuration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --uninstall</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Full purge (uninstalls and deletes all database files permanently)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install.sh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --uninstall</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --purge</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Accessing Your Panel</h2>\n<p>Once installation completes, open your browser and navigate to:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>http://&#x3C;your-server-ip>:3000</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>Follow the <strong>First-Run Setup</strong> guide to claim your admin account using your <code>SETUP_TOKEN</code>.</p>"
