    "html": "<h2>Cấu trúc thư mục</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  features/&#x3C;feature>/   # Logic tính năng (ví dụ: apps.server.ts, apps.query.ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  components/           # Giao diện Mantine UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  routes/               # File-based routes của TanStack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server/               # Nitro plugins, scheduler, dịch vụ kết nối SSH/Docker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>templates/              # Các mẫu ứng dụng marketplace (template.toml)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>drizzle/                # File SQL migrations</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Tiêu chuẩn mã nguồn</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Linter &#x26; Formatter:</strong> <a href=\"https://biomejs.dev/\">Biome</a>. Chạy <code>bun run check</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Đa ngôn ngữ:</strong> <a href=\"https://lingui.dev/\">Lingui</a>. Mọi chuỗi hiển thị đều phải qua hàm <code>i18n._()</code>.</li>\n</ul>"
